  "题目7": "【单项选择】选出最恰当的一项。\n题干：The ______ of the town grew quickly.\nA. populous\nB. population\nC. popular\nD. populate\n考点：词性转换",
  "答案": "【1】C（印度人口众多）\n讲解：populous 人口众多的。\n【2】populous\n讲解：说人口多用 populous；popular 是受欢迎。\n【3】D（popular）\n讲解：受青少年欢迎用 popular with；populous 只说人多。\n【4】population\n讲解：a large 后面要名词“人口”population。\n【5】more → most\n讲解：三者之中比较用最高级 most populous。\n【6】more；populous\n讲解：有 than 用比较级 more populous。\n【7】B（population）\n讲解：the … of 后面要名词 population；populous 是形容词。"
